## Monorepo

- Package manager: **pnpm only** (no npm/yarn). Details — [stack](../../docs/tech-stack.md) §8.
- Apps: `apps/web` (React + Vite), `apps/api` (NestJS). Layout — [architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §3.
- Shared packages — in `packages/` as needed.
- On-disk files — `storage/` (uploads/results/profile), **not in git**; client must not access it ([architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §3.3).

## Conversion model

- One operation = **one file** ([task](../../docs/technical-task.md) §2).
- Flow: upload → `ConversionJob` (`queued` → `processing` → `completed`/`failed`) → polling → download ([architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §4.1).
- Formats v1: JPG↔PNG (Sharp), DOCX↔PDF (LibreOffice в Docker) ([stack](../../docs/tech-stack.md) §4).
- Limits: 10 MB, 60s timeout, rate limits per [task](../../docs/technical-task.md) §7.6.

## Auth

| Channel | Mechanism |
| ------- | --------- |
| SPA / account | JWT in httpOnly cookie |
| Public API `/api/v1/*` | `X-API-Key` |
| Share `/s/:token` | public token, no login |

## Out of scope v1

Batch conversion, Redis/BullMQ, S3/CDN, 2FA, Docker Compose for PostgreSQL, horizontal autoscaling — see [architecture](../../docs/architecture.md) §6 and [task](../../docs/technical-task.md) §1.

## Code & DX

- Strict TypeScript; no `any` without reason.
- Linter: **Oxlint**. Tests: Vitest (unit), Playwright (e2e).
- UI error messages — **in Russian**.
- Do not commit `.env`, secrets, or `storage/` contents. Security checklist — [security.mdc](./security.mdc).
